      en: "Puerta del Diablo (The Devil's Door) is a dramatic rock formation consisting of two massive split boulders reaching toward the sky. Located in the Planes de Renderos, it offers spectacular panoramic views of the capital, Lake Ilopango, and the Pacific coastline."
